#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:7
#: 6592cd0bcb044d4798a682a230aba84d
msgid ""
"`BeagleBone Blue <https://beagleboard.org/blue>`__ (BBBlue) is a complete, "
"Linux-enabled robotics computer. Community-supported and fully open-source, "
"the real-time performance, flexible networking and rich set of robotics-"
"oriented peripherals make building mobile robots quick and affordable."
msgstr ""
"`BeagleBone Blue <https://beagleboard.org/blue>`__（BBBlue）是一款完整的 Linux "
"机器人计算机。社区支持且完全开源，实时性能、灵活的网络以及丰富的机器人外设使构建移动机器人既快速又经济实惠。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:12
#: 54bb27865b9544fbb6a0ecd94cc0367a
msgid "Copter support was added in Copter-3.5."
msgstr "Copter 支持已在 Copter-3.5 中加入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:22
#: 231123339ee54df4879ed667427abfc8
msgid ""
"Confer the `schematic(s) <https://github.com/beagleboard/beaglebone-"
"blue/blob/master/BeagleBone_Blue_sch.pdf>`__ from `BBBlue repo "
"<https://github.com/beagleboard/beaglebone-blue/>`__ for more details."
msgstr ""
"有关详细信息，请参阅 `BBBlue 仓库 <https://github.com/beagleboard/beaglebone-blue/>`__ "
"中的 `原理图 <https://github.com/beagleboard/beaglebone-"
"blue/blob/master/BeagleBone_Blue_sch.pdf>`__。"

