#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:62
#: e7655752731c4c0eb22ce34a0d002d29
msgid ""
"Download the latest buster-console image from https://rcn-"
"ee.net/rootfs/bb.org/testing/ (`bone-debian-10.11-console-"
"armhf-2021-12-01-1gb.img.xz <https://rcn-"
"ee.net/rootfs/bb.org/testing/2021-12-01/buster-console/bone-"
"debian-10.11-console-armhf-2021-12-01-1gb.img.xz>`__ used in this example)."
msgstr ""
"从 https://rcn-ee.net/rootfs/bb.org/testing/ 下载最新的 buster-console 镜像（本示例使用 "
"`bone-debian-10.11-console-armhf-2021-12-01-1gb.img.xz <https://rcn-"
"ee.net/rootfs/bb.org/testing/2021-12-01/buster-console/bone-"
"debian-10.11-console-armhf-2021-12-01-1gb.img.xz>`__）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:66
#: f53e3529e1f64a18a4c1aa716ef389a3
msgid ""
"In case this image does not exist anymore or is outdated, go to https://rcn-"
"ee.net/rootfs/bb.org/testing/ and look for the most recent folder that "
"contains a ``...-console`` folder with image - it contains all we need and "
"is usually around 150 MB. The ``...-iot`` could also be used but is bigger. "
"Basically just look for the smallest and most recent ``bone-...`` image, as "
"you can always install more software if needed."
msgstr ""
"若该镜像已不存在或已过时，请访问 https://rcn-ee.net/rootfs/bb.org/testing/ 并寻找最新的含 "
"``...-console`` 子文件夹的目录——该目录包含所需内容且通常约 150MB。也可使用 ``...-iot`` "
"版本，但体积更大。基本上只需寻找最小且最新的 ``bone-...`` 镜像，因为之后可随时安装更多软件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:68
#: 424c2cc195724b3881f80322ec0eef0b
