#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:165
#: d2dcba7d662f45489cd341ac38c3f9bc
msgid "Setting up ArduPilot"
msgstr "配置 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:167
#: 5c3df49608dd47a59c7839abac799c3e
msgid ""
"The following instructions show how to setup ArduPlane. It is the same for "
"other vehicle types just replace ``plane`` by e.g. ``copter`` etc. (see "
"`Building ArduPilot "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__). It is "
"also possible to setup multiple vehicle types on the same system."
msgstr ""
"以下说明展示如何配置 ArduPlane。其他机型的步骤相同，只需将 ``plane`` 替换为如 ``copter`` 等（参见 `Building "
"ArduPilot "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__）。也可以在同一系统上配置多种机型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:169
#: e9a574fe5b624351bdf94f4e90b376bb
msgid ""
"Create an empty service file so that ardupilot automatically starts on boot "
"and runs in the background:"
msgstr "创建一个空的服务文件，使 ardupilot 在启动时自动在后台运行："

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:175
#: acca95b821494d72afacad6d6d7f7ecf
msgid ""
"Paste following text. And replace ``<target IP address>`` with the IP "
"address of the telemetry receiving computer:"
msgstr "粘贴以下内容，并将 ``<target IP address>`` 替换为接收数传的计算机 IP 地址："

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:197
#: 3e38380dcaca4d3f865c0d6aac2f0a0e
msgid ""
"Download the latest ArduPilot binary for the ``blue`` target/FC from "
"https://firmware.ardupilot.org/ (`Plane/stable-4.1.6/blue/arduplane "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Plane/stable-4.1.6/blue/arduplane>`__ used "
"in this example). Copy this file to `/usr/bin/ardupilot/`."
msgstr ""
"从 https://firmware.ardupilot.org/ 下载针对 ``blue`` 目标/飞控的最新 ArduPilot "
"二进制文件（本示例使用 `Plane/stable-4.1.6/blue/arduplane "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Plane/stable-4.1.6/blue/arduplane>`__）。将此文件复制到"
" `/usr/bin/ardupilot/`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:203
#: 723dcd34cf5a457ca590976e0edd8544
msgid ""
"Alternatively there are other possible sources like the "
"https://custom.ardupilot.org/ build server or you can compile it yourself "
"(see `Cross compiling ArduPilot from source`_)."
msgstr ""
"也可使用 https://custom.ardupilot.org/ 编译服务器等其他来源，或自行编译（参见「Cross compiling "
"ArduPilot from source」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:207
#: 0f2069c68b3f444d8bfd38e7577f43a4
msgid ""
"In case this image does not exist anymore or is outdated, go to "
"https://firmware.ardupilot.org/ and look for the vehicle type you want. Then"
" look for the firmware you want - usually the most recent ``stable`` - and "
"within that folder look for ``blue``. In this folder you will find some text"
" files and the firmware binary/executable."
msgstr ""
"若该镜像已不存在或已过时，请访问 https://firmware.ardupilot.org/ 并寻找所需机型，然后找到所需固件（通常为最新的 "
"``stable`` 版本），在该文件夹中找到 ``blue``。该文件夹中包含一些文本文件和固件二进制/可执行文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:216
#: e742105524f44a0e90edde92444caf6e
msgid ""
"Your BBBlue is now ready to connect to a Ground Control Station (e.g. "
"`MissionPlanner <https://ardupilot.org/planner/docs/mission-planner-"
"installation.html>`__ or  `QGroundControl <http://qgroundcontrol.com/>`__ )"
msgstr ""
"您的 BBBlue 现在可以连接到地面控制站（如 `MissionPlanner "
"<https://ardupilot.org/planner/docs/mission-planner-installation.html>`__ 或 "
"`QGroundControl <http://qgroundcontrol.com/>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:218
#: 4872317045f244c98282702a54d1cfee
msgid "When establishing a connection select UDP on port 14550."
msgstr "建立连接时，在端口 14550 上选择 UDP。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:220
#: 1c9ec6cc4a1944629f643224a7fd38e8
msgid ""
"More information can be found in section `Connect BBBlue to a Ground Station"
" Software`_"
msgstr "更多信息请参见「Connect BBBlue to a Ground Station Software」章节"

