msgstr "获取 BBBlue Wifi 接口的 IP："

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:262
#: 265d2847bce5473691618c19063241b9
msgid "ssh by wifi into the BBBlue."
msgstr "通过 Wifi SSH 连接到 BBBlue。"

