msgid "Via shared internet connection"
msgstr "通过共享网络连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:267
#: 346d1b28cbb348279d1193c666997a60
msgid "Refer to `Quick Start`_"
msgstr "参见「快速入门」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:271
#: c21aaa2e63eb4326b15d37d79b7f5f0d
msgid "`Cross compiling ArduPilot from source`"
msgstr "「从源码交叉编译 ArduPilot」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:273
#: 5af8f065879e43469c243e03512d6019
msgid ""
"Generally you can compile ArduPilot on the BBBlue itself. But this takes a "
"lot of time (several hours) and a lot of space (you need to maximize/grow "
"the partition on the SD card to fit) and is therefore not recommended."
msgstr ""
"通常可以在 BBBlue 上直接编译 ArduPilot，但这需要大量时间（数小时）和大量空间（需要扩展 SD 卡上的分区），因此不推荐此方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:275
#: 79cf88c43a1b4c349e9ca2843ec788d9
msgid ""
"Install Ubuntu 20.04 64-Bit as build machine (e.g. can be VM or github "
"action)."
msgstr "安装 Ubuntu 20.04 64 位作为编译机器（可以是虚拟机或 GitHub Action）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:284
#: 3b9db8bddf3344908a4b700b691d1683
msgid ""
"use either the stable tag ``ArduPlane-stable`` or the current Plane branch "
"``Plane-4.1`` (in the moment both refer to Plane-4.1.6) - make sure to use a"
" ``stable`` version"
msgstr ""
"使用稳定标签 ``ArduPlane-stable`` 或当前 Plane 分支 ``Plane-4.1``（目前两者均指向 "
"Plane-4.1.6）——确保使用 ``stable`` 版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:296
#: ffaebb2a40a44939bceccc9da7aded03
msgid "binary is located in ``build/blue/bin/``."
msgstr "二进制文件位于 ``build/blue/bin/``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:299
