msgid "Kernel configuration"
msgstr "内核配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:301
#: f925d5e0ac2b46d9812be43c483cc983
msgid ""
"In this section we update the kernel. There are two types of kernels: Real-"
"time and regular (default). In this guide we will configure the real-time "
"kernel v5.10 RT. Refer to `elinux.org/Beagleboard "
"<https://elinux.org/Beagleboard:BeagleBoneBlack_Debian#Kernel_Options>`__  "
